OL,3,GNEWSADrug-driving arrest after lorry
OL,4,Acrash shuts road
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe vehicle is being recovered and the
OL,7,Fscene is being cleared-up, National
OL,8,FHighways said, with diversions in place
OL,9,Fand drivers urged to allow extra time
OL,10,Ffor their journey and follow signed
OL,11,Fdiversion routes.
